    "liveMatrix": {
      "date": "2026-09-28",
      "result": "kimi-k2p6 is still listed on /models but a real chat call now returns 404 'not deployed', which failed the nightly model-liveness gate from 2026-09-26 and sent the matrix vision test down the text-only fallback. kimi-k3 answers a text call and a call carrying a PNG with 200, so it becomes the default; gpt-oss-120b, qwen3p8-max and glm-5p3 also answer text calls. Earlier (2026-08-30): deepseek-v4-pro was listed but hung past 120s, six ids returned 404 'not deployed', and glm-5p3 answers 'does not support image inputs'."
    },
